renegotiates out to Phase 08 — **never** the peer (D-07-20) and **never** the
seeded faults (D-07-24). **D-07-27** — the deferred item is the interprocedural
*liveness* re-derivation, its D-03-02 lineage, its closure phase (09), and its
closure gate verbatim; the signature-summary peer is explicitly **not** part of
that deferral.
</objective>

