<threat_model>
## Trust Boundaries

| Boundary | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| producer -> summary artifact | `originvalidate.BuildInterface` writes a `lang.interface/1` document that later admission paths trust without opening a callee body |
| summary artifact -> consumer | a decoded `core.Interface` crosses into `protocol`/`session` projections and, from Phase 08 onward, into caller admission |
| checked core -> validator | `corevalidate` consumes a `core.Program` it did not produce, including synthetic or forged ones |

## STRIDE Threat Register

| Threat ID | Category | Component | Severity | Disposition | Mitigation Plan |
|-----------|----------|-----------|----------|-------------|-----------------|
| T-07-01 | Repudiation | `originvalidate.BuildInterface` + `corevalidate` summary peer | high | mitigate | Two independently-written derivations, never a shared `callsummary` helper (D-07-20/D-07-22), enforced by the static import-independence test in Task 3 and exercised by Task 4's three seeded faults |
