    - internal/compiler/protocol/protocol.go:123-131 and internal/compiler/session/session_phase6_evidence.go:17-25 — `TruncatedEvidenceTraceBound`, the named-const truncation convention `truncated:core.call_cycle_bound` copies
    - .planning/phases/07-calls-signatures-and-call-graph-refusal/07-CONTEXT.md — D-07-15, D-07-16, D-07-17, D-07-18
