   361	// TestCancelledOutcomeIsUnconstructible is D-04-08's fail-closed control:
   362	// the terminal-outcome axis reserves "cancelled" as unconstructible, and
   363	// this asserts it over the REACHABLE CONSTRUCTORS in every engine's own
   364	// source -- not over observed test output, which would be exactly the
   365	// vacuous evidence shape this project has already paid for three times
   366	// (03-08/03-09/03-10, D-10). No engine (interp, cgen, native) may ever
