    52	// the two mandatory admission policies (D-04-16), the name of the nullary
    53	// ADT its err edge carries (D-04-05), and (from Phase 4 plan 03, D-04-12) the
    54	// target record Layout plus the InitializedState/Capture/Retention/Aliasing
